  "title": "Butternut Squash Pecan Muffins",
  "description": "Roasted butternut squash meets warm spices and wheat bran for a tasty fall muffin topped with brown-sugared pecans.",
  "authors": [
    "Heather McIntosh"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:32:57-04:00",
